      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Muhammad Bin Yahya, by a chain of his, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘it is disliked if one were to recite ‘Say He<sup>azwj</sup> Allah<sup>azwj</sup> is One’ (Chapter 112) in one breath’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "11. Muhammad ibn Yahya through the chain of his narrators has narrated who has said the following: “Abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said that it is not desirable to recite all of Chapter 112 in one breath.” "
        ]
      }
